OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with overnight
OL,6,Frain clearing the region just after
OL,7,Fdawn. Turning partly cloudy with
OL,8,Fisolated showers developing by midday
OL,9,Fmainly to the west of the region with
OL,10,Fmany areas remaining dry. Near average
OL,11,Ftemperatures with fresh northwest
OL,12,Fwinds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers ease to leave a
OL,15,Fmostly partly cloudy and dry night for
OL,16,Fmuch of the region. Cloud building in
OL,17,Fthe west by dawn. Cooler overnight
OL,18,Fthan recently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
