OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloud building through the
OL,6,Fmorning with light rain developing
OL,7,Facross the region. This turns more
OL,8,Fpersistent during the afternoon before
OL,9,Feasing later. Fresh southwest winds.
OL,10,FNear average temperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FRemaining cloudy with further light
OL,14,Frain at times through Saturday and
OL,15,FSunday. Fresh winds and temperatures
OL,16,Fbecoming warmer. Drier and brighter on
OL,17,FMonday, with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
